# Terraform (as deploy/wfp): local state, plans, the R2 backend override. .terraform.lock.hcl stays
# tracked. Without this, a `terraform init` here leaves .terraform/ untracked, and every build from
# the clone reads -dirty (ggc.sh deployed as a0889bfcf082-dirty with no tracked change).
.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
backend_override.tf
terraform.tfstate.d/
